{
  "title": { "zh": "0 不等于 1" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "化简算得出 1 + 1，却证不出 0 ≠ 1：没有哪条定义说两者不同。说它们不同的是声明：<level-ref to=\"decl-nat\"></level-ref>的 nat = 0 | S nat 是<wiki-ref to=\"inductive\"></wiki-ref>，它给出的规则都在「数理规则书」里。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "in-distinct",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "words": ["everyday", "terms"],
      "types": ["nat"],
      "tests": [{ "goal": "¬(zero = s(zero))" }, { "goal": "¬(s(s(zero)) = zero)" }, { "goal": "¬(zero = s(a))" }],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "¬A 就是 A → ⊥。" },
        {
          "zh": "「数理规则书」里有 0 = S … 的规则；有一组测试的等式方向相反。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = impI()",
        "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = append(c0, first: c2, second: c3) {",
        "  first {",
        "    c2r0 = math[use=[\"nat.distinct1\"]]()",
        "    c2 = erule(c1.first, c2r0)",
        "  }",
        "  second {",
        "    c3r0 = math[use=[\"nat.distinct2\"]]()",
        "    c3 = erule(c1.second, c3r0)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "out <- c1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
